# Additional custom vocabulary overlayed on top of CMUdict


every EH1 V R IY0 # Cambridge US /ˈev.ri/; use the rhotic consonant variant
even IY1 V AH0 N # Cambridge US and Merriam-Webster /ˈiːvən/; correct IPA-Dict short-i reference
current K ER0 AH0 N T # Cambridge US /ˈkɝː.ənt/; correct the source dictionary's /ɑɹ/ variant

nth EH1 N TH # ordinal suffix, Cambridge US /ɛnθ/

ai EY1 AY1
buggie B AH1 G IY0
jedi JH EH1 D AY2
language L AE1 NG G W IH0 JH # Cambridge US /ˈlæŋ.ɡwɪdʒ/; restore the velar stop omitted by the override
llm EH1 L EH1 L EH1 M
naboo N AH0 B UW1
neuml N UW1 EH1 M EH1 L
singularity S IH2 NG G Y AH0 L EH1 R AH0 T IY0
tatooine T AE2 T W IY1 N
txtai T EH1 K S T EY1 AY1 # Text AI
json JH1 EY S2 AX N
the DH AH0
most M OW1 S T
last L AE1 S T
already AO0 L R EH1 D IY0
eventual IH0 V EH1 N CH UW0 AH0 L # Cambridge US /ɪˈven.tʃu.əl/; corrects the pinned schwa-onset variant
eventually IH0 V EH1 N CH UW0 AH0 L IY0 # Cambridge US /ɪˈven.tʃu.ə.li/; corrects the pinned consonant/vowel variant
thorough TH ER1 OW0
bouquet B UW0 K EY1
quay K IY1
modernization M AA2 D ER0 N AH0 Z EY1 SH AH0 N
result R IH0 Z AH1 L T
rely R IH0 L AY1
refused R IH0 F Y UW1 Z D
effect IH0 F EH1 K T
effective IH0 F EH1 K T IH0 V
effects IH0 F EH1 K T S
accountability AH0 K AW2 N T AH0 B IH1 L AH0 T IY0
collaborations K AH0 L AE2 B ER0 EY1 SH AH0 N Z
around AH0 R AW1 N D
runaround R AH1 N AX0 R AW2 N D
wind W IH1 N D # Default noun reading; the homograph table handles verb context.
real-estate R IY1 L IH0 S T EY2 T # Cambridge US and pinned CMUdict: primary stress on real, secondary on estate.
bennett B EH1 N IH0 T # Collins US: ˈbɛnɪt; surname spelling is not safely predicted by the broad -ett rule.
